second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"When was Rutherford High School established?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0360-205ba5c51ed7:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 119, \"text\": \"Rutherford High School (Florida) Rutherford High School is a public high school in Panama City, Florida, United States.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0360-205ba5c51ed7:d00\", \"start\": 120, \"end\": 279, \"text\": \"The school, which describes itself as the \\\"Home of the Rams\\\" and is a part of the Bay District Schools, opened in 1961 as the second high school in Bay County.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0360-205ba5c51ed7:d00\", \"start\": 280, \"end\": 334, \"text\": \"The school held its first graduation ceremony in 1964.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0360-205ba5c51ed7:d00\", \"start\": 335, \"end\": 381, \"text\": \"The school was accredited by the SACS in 1963.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0360-205ba5c51ed7:d00\", \"start\": 382, \"end\": 445, \"text\": \"In 2006, Rutherford had a student population of 1,755 students.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0360-205ba5c51ed7:d00\", \"start\": 446, \"end\": 517, \"text\": \"Rutherford High School offers several different tracks to its students.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0360-205ba5c51ed7:d00\", \"start\": 518, \"end\": 603, \"text\": \"Rutherford is host to a chapter of the International Baccalaureate program, Air Force\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0360-205ba5c51ed7:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 140, \"text\": \"Authority control databases : Geographic NCES Portals : Schools Florida Education Retrieved from `` https : //en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php ?\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0360-205ba5c51ed7:d01\", \"start\": 141, \"end\": 723, \"text\": \"title=Rutherford_High_School_ ( Florida ) & oldid=1282058141 `` Categories : Buildings and structures in Panama City , Florida Educational institutions established in 1961 High schools in Bay County , Florida Public high schools in Florida 1961 establishments in Florida Hidden categories : Pages using gadget WikiMiniAtlas Articles with short description Short description is different from Wikidata Use mdy dates from September 2024 Infobox mapframe without OSM relation ID on Wikidata Coordinates on Wikidata Pages using infobox school with unsupported parameters Pages using the\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0360-205ba5c51ed7:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 227, \"text\": \"Rutherford High School (New Jersey) Rutherford High School is a comprehensive four-year public high school located in Rutherford, in Bergen County, New Jersey, United States, operating as part of the Rutherford School District.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0360-205ba5c51ed7:d02\", \"start\": 228, \"end\": 305, \"text\": \"The original structure was built in 1922 and expanded in 1938, 1957 and 2005.\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0360-205ba5c51ed7:d02\", \"start\": 306, \"end\": 507, \"text\": \"Rutherford High School is overseen by the New Jersey Department of Education and has been accredited by the Middle States Association of Colleges and Schools Commission on Secondary Schools since 1940.\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0360-205ba5c51ed7:d02\", \"start\": 508, \"end\": 630, \"text\": \"As of the 2015-16 school year, the school had an enrollment of 750 students and 67.3 classroom teachers (on an FTE basis),\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0360-205ba5c51ed7:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 204, \"text\": \"Rutherford Technology High School Rutherford Technology High School (RTHS) is a secondary school located in Rutherford, a suburb of the city of Maitland in the Hunter Region of New South Wales, Australia.\"}, \"D4S2\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0360-205ba5c51ed7:d03\", \"start\": 205, \"end\": 349, \"text\": \"The current principal is Michael Whiting (who replaced Paul Tracey in Term 3 2009), and the deputy principals are Simone Hughes and Kylie Fabri.\"}, \"D4S3\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0360-205ba5c51ed7:d03\", \"start\": 350, \"end\": 376, \"text\": \"The school opened in 1985.\"}, \"D4S4\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0360-205ba5c51ed7:d03\", \"start\": 377, \"end\": 484, \"text\": \"It has a Student Representative Council containing 24 members, and had over 1200 students enrolled in 2012.\"}, \"D4S5\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0360-205ba5c51ed7:d03\", \"start\": 485, \"end\": 604, \"text\": \"Rutherford High has a limited agriculture facility, sporting facilities and a partially functioning music \\\"laboratory\\\".\"}, \"D4S6\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0360-205ba5c51ed7:d03\", \"start\": 605, \"end\": 658, \"text\": \"It is currently undergoing renovations throughout the\"}, \"D5S1\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0360-205ba5c51ed7:d04\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 153, \"text\": \"Rutherford High School - Panama City , Florida - FL | GreatSchools En Español Parenting Write a Review Review En Español My Account Update school ( s ) !\"}, \"D5S2\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0360-205ba5c51ed7:d04\", \"start\": 154, \"end\": 635, \"text\": \"New review Saved Schools Sign Out ADVERTISEMENT Florida › Panama City › Bay › Rutherford High School Rutherford High School Unclaimed 3 /10 GreatSchools Rating 6 reviews Public school · 1,337 Students · Grades 6-12 · Website